  What DarkProbe CANNOT do:
  - ❌ Decrypt WPA2-PSK encrypted data frames (requires passphrase +
  handshake + decryption logic)
  - ❌ Decrypt WPA2-Enterprise traffic (per-session keys from RADIUS/EAP)
  - ❌ Decrypt WPA3-SAE traffic (Simultaneous Authentication of Equals)
  - ❌ Extract WPA-Enterprise credentials (would need RADIUS MitM)
  - ❌ Put wireless interfaces into monitor mode programmatically

  Current Wireless Capabilities:
  The tool can passively observe:
  1. Unencrypted 802.11 management/control frames
  2. EAPOL authentication exchanges (handshakes)
  3. Post-authentication unencrypted traffic (if any)

  Would you like me to add WPA2 decryption support? This would require:
  - Capturing the 4-way handshake
  - Accepting a PSK/passphrase
  - Implementing PBKDF2 + AES-CCMP decryption
  - Monitor mode interface management

